  "question": {
    ":question/problem": "$$\nP=\\begin{bmatrix}\\boxed{0} & -2 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 0 & -2 \\\\ -2 & 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nIn index notation, the highlighted entry of the matrix $P$ above is ${p}_{ij},$ where$\\,$\n\n$i=$\n\n{{field-1}}\n\nand\n$j=$\n\n{{field-2}}\n\n.",
    ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
    ":question/worked-solution": "The entry ${p}_{ij}$ lies at the intersection of the $1$st row and $1$st column. Hence, we have $i=1$ and $j=1.$",
